                          </button></h2>
                        <ul aria-labelledby="accordion-id-1" class="accordion__content--footer" id="sect-1" role="list">
                           
<li><a href="https://www.purdue.edu/campus-map/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Campus Map">Campus Map</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.purdue.edu/home/careers/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Careers">Careers</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.purdue.edu/hr/CHL/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Center for Healthy Living">Center for Healthy Living</a></li>
